<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>BULKERS - Forum Glory - (built 1972) 68,017 dwt sold fot $2.65 million.</p>
<p>Ios - (built 1985) 65,298 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $13 million.</p>
<p>TANKERS - Cosmo Mercury - (built 1980) 65,581 dwt sold to undisclosed buyers for $7.95 million.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection, survey or other conditions.</p>
</text>
